<title>USA: Equifax raises stock buyback plan.</title>
<headline>Equifax raises stock buyback plan.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Equifax Inc said Wednesday it increased the amount of funds available for its stock buyback plan by $100 million to $130 million.</p>
</text>
